    <briefdescription>
<para>One client connection of the daemon: it reads the requests of the client, and sends each result back. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A client message holds a JSON array: the command, the working folder, and the arguments. The connection appends a request row for it below its connection row in the model. When the request row gets its result, the connection sends the result to the client, and it removes the request row. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
